{"name":"Blood of Zeus","hex":"#640f09","fetched":"2026-10-11","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"blood","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A vital liquid flowing in the bodies of many types of animals that usually conveys nutrients and oxygen. In vertebrates, it is colored red by hemoglobin, is conveyed by arteries and veins, is pumped by the heart and is usually generated in bone marrow.","A family relationship due to birth, such as that between siblings; contrasted with relationships due to marriage or adoption. See blood relative, blood relation."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To cause something to be covered with blood; to bloody.","To let blood (from); to bleed."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/blood"}],"entries":[{"title":"Blood of Zeus","blocks":[{"text":"Blood of Zeus, formerly known as Gods & Heroes, is an American adult animated fantasy action television series created and written by brothers Charley and Vlas Parlapanides for Netflix. Produced by Powerhouse Animation Studios and animated by South Korean studios Mua Film and Hanho Heung-Up, the first season premiered on October 27, 2020."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/1/1c/Gods_and_Heroes_teaser_poster.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Blood_of_Zeus","wikidata":"Q85763820"},{"title":"Blood","blocks":[{"text":"Blood is a specialized form of connective tissue and body fluid in the circulatory system of humans and other vertebrates that delivers necessary substances such as nutrients and oxygen to the cells of the body, and transports metabolic waste products away from those same cells."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/50/Venous_and_arterial_blood.jpg/330px-Venous_and_arterial_blood.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Blood","wikidata":"Q7873"},{"title":"Zeus","blocks":[{"text":"Zeus is the supreme deity of the Greek pantheon. He is a sky and thunder god in ancient Greek religion and mythology, who rules as king of the gods on Mount Olympus."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/20/Zeus_Otricoli_Pio-Clementino_Inv257.jpg/330px-Zeus_Otricoli_Pio-Clementino_Inv257.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Zeus","wikidata":"Q34201"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3d/1GZX_Haemoglobin.png/500px-1GZX_Haemoglobin.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3d/1GZX_Haemoglobin.png/1280px-1GZX_Haemoglobin.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3d/1GZX_Haemoglobin.png/500px-1GZX_Haemoglobin.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Hemoglobin, a globular proteingreen = haem (or heme) groupsred & blue = protein subunits","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3A1GZX_Haemoglobin.png"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5a/Krew_Frakcjonowana.jpg/120px-Krew_Frakcjonowana.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5a/Krew_Frakcjonowana.jpg/250px-Krew_Frakcjonowana.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5a/Krew_Frakcjonowana.jpg/120px-Krew_Frakcjonowana.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AKrew_Frakcjonowana.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ec/Blutkreislauf.png/120px-Blutkreislauf.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_